note draft

# SHELVED 2026-10-02 (base-v1-0019): signatures only; the sorted map is its own item (base-v1-0023). It declared tasks that bound nothing, so a call built clean and
# threw `stub` at run time; out of the build until it has bodies.

load @term/base/code/maybe
  find maybe

form b-plus-tree
  head k
  head v

  task get
    take self
    take key, like k
    like maybe

  task set
    take self, flex true
    take key, like k
    take value, like v

  task has
    take self
    take key, like k
    like boolean

  task remove
    take self, flex true
    take key, like k
    like boolean

  task range
    take self
    take start, like k
    take end, like k
    like list

  task get-size
    take self
    like u64

  task is-empty
    take self
    like boolean

  task min
    take self
    like maybe

  task max
    take self
    like maybe

  task clear
    take self, flex true